<section xml:id="sec-exercises">
      <title>Exercises</title>
      <exercise xml:id="ex-vector-arithmetic">
        <introduction>
          <p>Let <m>\vec{v}_{1} = (1,0,1,0)</m>, <m>\vec{v}_{2} = (0,2,3,4)</m>.</p>
        </introduction>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Compute <m>\vec{v}_{1} + \vec{v}_{2}</m>.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Compute <m>2(\vec{v}_{1} + \vec{v}_{2})</m>.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Compute <m>2 \vec{v}_{1} + 2 \vec{v}_{2}</m>. How does your answer compare to part (b)?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Compute <m>\vec{v}_{1} - \vec{v}_{2}</m>.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
      </exercise>
      <exercise xml:id="ex-system-vector-equation-1">
        <introduction>
          <p>Consider the linear system</p>
          <p>
            <md>\begin{aligned}
x+y+z &amp;= 3, \\
2x+3y+5z &amp;= 10, \\
4x+9y+25z &amp;= 39
\end{aligned}</md>
          </p>
        </introduction>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Write the augmented matrix of the system.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Write the system as a vector equation.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Which one is your favorite?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
      </exercise>
      <exercise xml:id="ex-system-vector-equation-2">
        <introduction>
          <p>Consider the linear system</p>
          <p>
            <md>\begin{aligned}
x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3} + x_{4} + x_{5} + x_{6} &amp;= 10, \\
x_{1} + x_{3} + x_{5} &amp;= 5, \\
x_{2} + x_{4} + x_{6} &amp;= 5
\end{aligned}</md>
          </p>
        </introduction>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Write the augmented matrix of the system.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Write the system as a vector equation.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Solve the system of equations and write the linear function with vector coefficients describing the solution set.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
      </exercise>
      <exercise xml:id="ex-span-question">
        <introduction>
          <p>Consider the following question: <q>Is <m>(1,0,1)</m> in the span of <m>(1,2,3)</m> and <m>(3,2,1)</m>?</q>
          </p>
        </introduction>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Rewrite this question as a vector equation.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Rewrite it as a system of linear equations.</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
        <task>
          <statement>
            <p>Solve the linear system. Is the answer yes?</p>
          </statement>
        </task>
      </exercise>
      <exercise xml:id="ex-linear-independence">
        <statement>
          <p>Are <m>(1,0,1)</m>, <m>(1,2,3)</m>, and <m>(3,2,1)</m> linearly independent? Explain why or why not.</p>
        </statement>
      </exercise>
    </section>